veltos-graphics (1.1.0~dev3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The same pkcon fixes (no debconf socket, waiting for other installs).
  * The progress says when it waits for another installation or builds the
    driver; after an install it asks to restart now or later.
  * NVIDIA: the install and updates bring libnvidia-egl-gbm1 (contrib),
    which KWin needs for screens on the NVIDIA card under Wayland and
    which Debian's nvidia-driver does not pull in.
  * The window follows light/dark and the accent while open (themewatch.py).

